{"id":"2a2956bd163a276b","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-lebesgue-decomposition.md","title":"Lebesgue Decomposition","display":"df-lebesgue-decomposition — Lebesgue Decomposition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lebesgue-decomposition","aliases":["58-df-lebesgue-decomposition"],"display":"df-lebesgue-decomposition — Lebesgue Decomposition","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lebesgue-decomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lebesgue-decomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lebesgue-decomposition — Lebesgue Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc3c1d6f4dc7038c\" href=\"?note=fc3c1d6f4dc7038c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md\">../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,\\nu,\\nu_a,\\nu_s,X,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(\\mu,\\nu,\\nu_a,\\nu_s,X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{MutuallySingularMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{MutuallySingularMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (measure relations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc3c1d6f4dc7038c\" href=\"?note=fc3c1d6f4dc7038c\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md\">../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueDecomp}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueDecomp}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (Lebesgue-decomposition predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\mathrm{LebesgueDecomp}_S(\\nu,\\nu_a,\\nu_s,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_a,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_s,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\nu=\\nu_a+\\nu_s\\land\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S(\\nu_a,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{MutuallySingularMeasure}_S(\\nu_s,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\mathrm{LebesgueDecomp}_S(\\nu,\\nu_a,\\nu_s,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_a,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_s,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\nu=\\nu_a+\\nu_s\\land\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S(\\nu_a,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{MutuallySingularMeasure}_S(\\nu_s,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Radon–Nikodym derivative <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\nu/d\\mu\">\\(d\\nu/d\\mu\\)</span> exists precisely for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu \\ll \\mu\">\\(\\nu \\ll \\mu\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Lebesgue decomposition separates absolutely continuous and singular parts.</li>\n<li>Special case: Lebesgue measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> decomposes functions into absolutely continuous, singular, and jump parts.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md","status":"resolved","id":"fc3c1d6f4dc7038c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (measure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md","status":"resolved","id":"fc3c1d6f4dc7038c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{MutuallySingularMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (measure relations, see [[../batch19/58-df-absolute-continuity.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu,\\nu,\\nu_a,\\nu_s,X,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S,\\mathrm{MutuallySingularMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueDecomp}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}decomposition} \\vdash \\mathrm{LebesgueDecomp}_S(\\nu,\\nu_a,\\nu_s,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_a,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu_s,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\nu=\\nu_a+\\nu_s\\land\\mathrm{AbsolutelyContinuousMeasure}_S(\\nu_a,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{MutuallySingularMeasure}_S(\\nu_s,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)","display":true},{"tex":"d\\nu/d\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu \\ll \\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}","display":false}],"bytes":1547,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-765","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-lebesgue-decomposition.md|58-df-lebesgue-decomposition]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728","fc3c1d6f4dc7038c"]}